msgid "基本の使い方"
msgstr "Basic Usage"

msgid "hedit の全体。上段が出力欄、下段がコード欄、左が Explorer"
msgstr "Full view of hedit. Top section is the output panel, bottom section is the code editor, left side is the Explorer."

